    },
    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "dye pouring technique",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "伝統的な注染の浴衣は、涼しげな風合いが魅力だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "京都の注染は日本の伝統的な染色技法である",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "注染で染められた手ぬぐいは独特の風合いが特徴だ",
              "citation": {
